guide forever/horde/50-60/02-felwood
title Felwood & Western Plaguelands
faction Horde
levels 52-54
zone Felwood
next forever/horde/50-60/03-winterspring
# Built from the playthrough simulator's consensus route (Horde, visits
# 70-73) and machine-checked with lint; not play-tested on Forever yet.
#
# Flow: Light's Hope Chapel -> fly to the Undercity -> ride east past the
# Bulwark: Felstone Farm -> Scarlet camp -> Dalson's Tears -> Mulgris
# Deepriver -> Sorrow Hill -> Andorhal (Chromie) -> Mulgris and his bears ->
# Tirion Fordring -> Kirsta Deepshadow and Hearthglen -> the Bulwark ->
# zeppelin to Orgrimmar, fly to Splintertree Post, ride north into Felwood:
# Emerald Sanctuary -> Jaedenar -> Emerald Sanctuary and Deadwood Village ->
# Jaedenar -> Bloodvenom Post (flight path) and the Jadefire moonwell ->
# Shatter Scar Vale -> Irontree Woods -> Felpaw Village -> back south to the
# Emerald Sanctuary and Overlord Ror -> Bloodvenom Post -> Felpaw Village
# (grind to 54) -> through Timbermaw Hold to Everlook, where the next guide
# starts.
#
# Deviations from the export:
# - The two Western Plaguelands visits (70 and 73) are one loop, before
#   Felwood: Kirsta, Tirion, Marlene and Chromie are all on it. This drops
#   the export's hearth from Felwood to Light's Hope Chapel and its long trip
#   from the Plaguelands to Everlook; Felwood's north end leads straight into
#   Winterspring.
# - Western Plaguelands order: Sorrow Hill, Chromie and Mulgris' bears come
#   before Kirsta Deepshadow, so you have the level for her Hearthglen quest
#   (6025, red below 53) without grinding first. It adds about three minutes
#   of riding.
# - Scarlet Diversions, A Plague Upon Thee and the Bulwark's Scourgestones
#   were picked up in the previous guide; A Call to Arms (5094) was handed in
#   there.
# - Felwood: Jaedenar's cultists are cleared first so Greta's moonwell water
#   (5157) fits in the loop; Overlord Ror (6162) is killed on the ride back
#   south and Dreka'Sur's turn-in is on the final ride north.
# - Dropped: A Matter of Time and both Counting Out Time (4971-4973): Chromie
#   only offers them from level 53, and the loop reaches Andorhal just before
#   it. The old Timbermaw Ally and Deadwood of the North (6131, 6221) are
#   pre-1.11 copies of 8460 and 8461, which the game offers instead.
# - Optional: the Scourgestone turn-ins (5402, 5403, 5407, 5408: repeatable,
#   20 Minion's or 10 Invader's stones each, worn Argent Dawn Commission),
#   Feathers for Grazle and Nafien (8466, 8467: repeatable Timbermaw
#   turn-ins), Deadwood Ritual Totem (8470: a rare drop) and Arko'narin's
#   chain (5202, 5203, 5204, 5385), which starts from a Blood Red Key that
#   only drops now and then in Jaedenar.
# - Grind: level 54 at Felpaw Village before Winterspring, which makes up for
#   the dropped Chromie quests and raises Timbermaw reputation for the tunnel.
# - Grind: level 53 at the Northridge Lumber Camp before Kirsta's last task
#   (6025 needs 53).
# - Checked and not added: Counting Out Time (4972) needs A Matter of Time
#   (4971; Chromie, level 53), which the Silithus guide does when it passes
#   Andorhal at 58. Silver Heart (4084) needs Linken's Memory (3942), which
#   the route only accepts at 57. Guarding Secrets (4883) needs the
#   Blue-feathered Necklace quest (4882), which comes after Wild Guardians
#   (4741) at about 57. Target: Writhing Haunt and its return (5233, 5234)
#   need the Felstone Field and Dalson's Tears cauldrons first; the route
#   does those at 58.
# - Emerald Sanctuary, on the way back south: Taronn, Greta and Jessir, who
#   stand together, before Maybess Riverbreeze on the west side.
#
# Left open for later guides: Better Late Than Never (5023, Royal Overseer
# Bauhaus), Little Pamela (5142), Glyphed Oaken Branch (4987, Nara Wildmane),
# All Along the Watchtowers (5098), Target: Felstone Field (5229), A Plague
# Upon Thee (5902), Tirion's Demon Dogs, Blood Tinged Skies and Carrion
# Grubbage (5542-5544), Brother Carlin (5210), Seeking Spiritual Aid (5158,
# Islen Waterseer), Speak to Salfa (8465), Runecloth (6031), Wild Guardians
# (4521) and The Strength of Corruption (4120, Talo Thornhoof).

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Western Plaguelands

step Fly to the Undercity
  zone Undercity
  tip From Light's Hope Chapel's flight master, fly to the Undercity.
  fly "Undercity"

step Janice Felstone
  zone Western Plaguelands
  tip Leave the Undercity and ride east along the road through Tirisfal Glades, past the Bulwark. Felstone Farm is the first farm along the road; Janice waits in the house.
  accept 5021
  turnin 5021                         -- Janice's Parcel, beside the house
  accept 5023
  note Keep the parcel: Royal Overseer Bauhaus is in the Undercity.

step Scarlet forward camp
  tip The Scarlet Crusade's tents stand between Felstone Field and Dalson's Tears. Torch the command tent with the Box of Incendiaries and plant the Scourge banner.
  interact 176088
  complete 5096

step Dalson's Tears farmhouse
  tip The diary lies in the farmhouse, the cabinet stands inside and the outhouse is behind it. A Wandering Skeleton carries the outhouse key; Farmer Dalson comes out when you open the outhouse and carries the cabinet key.
  accept 5058                         -- Mrs. Dalson's Diary
  turnin 5058
  accept 5060                         -- Locked Cabinet
  accept 5059                         -- Outhouse
  collect 12738 quest 5059
  turnin 5059
  collect 12739 quest 5060 @48.1,49.7 -- Farmer Dalson
  turnin 5060

step Mulgris Deepriver
  tip He camps by the Writhing Haunt, south-east of Dalson's Tears.
  accept 4984

step Sorrow Hill
  tip Ride south past the Writhing Haunt to Sorrow Hill; Marlene's house stands by the road, and Joseph Redpath's monument is in the graveyard behind it. Kill the Diseased Wolves you meet in the fields on the way.
  kill 1817 quest 4984 optional
  turnin 5152                         -- Marlene Redpath
  accept 5142
  accept 5153
  collect 12894 quest 5153 @49.7,76.8
  accept 5402 optional                -- Argent Officer Pureheart, at the graveyard's south end
  accept 5403 optional
  turnin 5402 optional
  turnin 5403 optional
  note Keep Little Pamela: Pamela is in Darrowshire, visited again later.

step Chromie
  tip Ride north-west into Andorhal. Chromie waits in the ruined inn on the west side of town; the skeletons inside are 54-57, so keep to the edges.
  turnin 5153
  accept 5154

step The Annals of Darrowshire
  tip The Annals lie among the Musty Tomes in Andorhal's town hall; open them until you find the right one.
  collect 12900 quest 5154 @43.4,69.5

step Chromie
  turnin 5154
  accept 5210
  note Brother Carlin goes to Light's Hope Chapel: keep it for later.

step Diseased Wolves
  tip The wolves roam the fields between Andorhal, Dalson's Tears and the Writhing Haunt. Finish them on the ride back east.
  kill 1817 quest 4984

step Mulgris Deepriver
  turnin 4984
  accept 4985

step Diseased Grizzlies
  tip The bears roam the hills north and east of the Writhing Haunt.
  kill 1816 quest 4985

step Mulgris Deepriver
  turnin 4985
  accept 4987
  note Keep the branch: Nara Wildmane is in Thunder Bluff.

step Tirion Fordring
  tip Ride north along the eastern hills; Tirion lives in a small house by the Thondroril River, at the border with the Eastern Plaguelands.
  accept 5542
  accept 5543
  accept 5544
  note Tirion's hunts are in the Eastern Plaguelands: keep them for later.

step Kirsta Deepshadow
  tip Ride west to the Northridge Lumber Camp; Kirsta hides on the hill north-east of it.
  accept 6004

step Scarlet Crusade
  tip Knights and magi work the Northridge Lumber Camp; the medics and hunters camp south of it.
  kill 10605 quest 6004.1
  kill 1831 quest 6004.2
  kill 1833 quest 6004.4
  kill 1826 quest 6004.3

step Kirsta Deepshadow
  turnin 6004
  accept 6023

step Radley and Durgen
  tip Huntsman Radley stands east of the lumber camp; Cavalier Durgen guards the road north-east of Kirsta, toward Hearthglen.
  kill 11613 quest 6023
  kill 11611 quest 6023

step Kirsta Deepshadow
  turnin 6023

step Northridge Lumber Camp
  tip Kirsta's last task needs level 53. The Scarlet Knights and Magi (54-55) working the lumber camp just south-west of her are the closest camp.
  level 53 -- grind on Scarlet Knights at Northridge Lumber Camp, Western Plaguelands

step Kirsta Deepshadow
  accept 6025

step Hearthglen
  tip Hearthglen's Scarlets are level 58-60. Ride in to the high point marked on your map, look over the town, and get out.
  complete 6025 @45.5,18.6

step Kirsta Deepshadow
  turnin 6025

step The Bulwark
  zone Tirisfal Glades
  tip Ride south-west past Felstone Farm and follow the road west back to the Bulwark.
  turnin 5096                         -- High Executor Derrington
  accept 5098
  accept 5228
  turnin 5228                         -- Shadow Priestess Vandis
  accept 5229
  turnin 5407 optional                -- Argent Officer Garush
  turnin 5408 optional
  turnin 5901                         -- Mickey Levine
  accept 5902
  note Derrington's watchtowers, Vandis' cauldron and Mickey's barrel are done on a later visit: keep them.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- To Felwood

step To Felwood
  zone Ashenvale
  tip Ride back to the Undercity, take the zeppelin to Orgrimmar and fly to Splintertree Post. Follow the road west out of Splintertree and take the fork north into Felwood.
  fly "Splintertree Post"

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Emerald Sanctuary and Jaedenar

step Emerald Sanctuary
  zone Felwood
  tip The druids' camp is just past the border.
  accept 5156                         -- Taronn Redfeather
  accept 5155                         -- Greta Mosshoof
  accept 4102                         -- Maybess Riverbreeze, just west of the camp

step Southern Jaedenar
  tip Follow the road north-west. The south of Jaedenar, around its corrupted moonwell, is held by Shadow Council cultists, adepts, guardsmen and their hounds.
  kill 7125 quest 5155.1
  kill 7115 quest 5155.3
  kill 7112 quest 5155.4
  kill 7113 quest 5155.2

step A Strange Red Key
  tip Only if a Blood Red Key dropped: use it to start the quest, then free Arko'narin in her cage in Shadow Hold, the cave at the north end of Jaedenar, and escort her out.
  accept 5202 optional
  turnin 5202 optional                -- Captured Arko'narin
  accept 5203 optional
  complete 5203 optional

step Emerald Sanctuary
  tip Ride back south-east to the Sanctuary.
  turnin 5155                         -- Greta Mosshoof
  accept 5157
  turnin 5203 optional                -- Jessir Moonbow
  accept 5204 optional
  accept 8460                         -- Grazle, at the south edge of the camp

step Deadwood Village
  tip The Deadwood furbolg village lies just south of the Sanctuary. Every Deadwood kill also raises your Timbermaw Hold reputation; keep the headdress feathers.
  kill 7153 quest 8460.1
  kill 7155 quest 8460.2
  kill 7154 quest 8460.3

step Grazle
  turnin 8460
  accept 8462
  accept 8466 optional                -- Only with 5 Deadwood Headdress Feathers
  turnin 8466 optional

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- North through Felwood

step The Jaedenar moonwell
  tip Back north to Jaedenar. Fill Greta's canteen at the corrupted moonwell in the middle of the southern camp.
  collect 12907 quest 5157 @35.2,59.8

step Rakaiah
  tip Only if you rescued Arko'narin: the succubus Rakaiah waits in the middle of Jaedenar, beside the Remains of Trey Lightforge.
  kill 9518 quest 5204 optional
  turnin 5204 optional                -- Remains of Trey Lightforge
  accept 5385 optional

step Bloodvenom Post
  tip The Horde camp just north of Jaedenar.
  getfp "Bloodvenom Post"
  accept 6162                         -- Dreka'Sur
  accept 4505                         -- Winna Hazzard
  accept 4521                         -- Trull Failbane: the owlbeasts are in Winterspring

step The Jadefire moonwell
  tip Ride back south past Jaedenar to the corrupted moonwell of the Jadefire satyrs and fill Winna's flasket there.
  collect 12567 quest 4505 @32.3,66.6

step Winna Hazzard
  turnin 4505
  accept 4506

step Winna's kitten
  tip Take the kitten to the same moonwell and release it there; once it has turned into a Corrupted Saber, bring it back to Winna and click on it to hand it over.
  goto 32.3,66.6 "Jadefire moonwell"
  complete 4506

step Winna Hazzard
  turnin 4506

step Shatter Scar Vale
  tip East of Bloodvenom Post, the cratered vale where the Entropic Beasts and Horrors roam. Kill two of each, then walk to each of the three fel-water craters.
  kill 9878 quest 5156.1
  kill 9879 quest 5156.2
  goto 41.6,43.0 "Southern crater"
  goto 40.4,41.2 "Western crater"
  goto 42.2,40.3 "Northern crater"
  complete 5156

step Irontree Woods
  tip Follow the road north-east to Irontree Woods. The Warpwood Moss Flayers and Shredders on the east side of the woods each carry a Blood Amber; Angerclaw Grizzlies and Felpaw Ravagers roam the same woods for Talo.
  collect 11503 quest 4102
  kill 8957 quest 4120.1
  kill 8961 quest 4120.2

step Nafien
  tip The road ends at Nafien, outside the Timbermaw Hold tunnel in the far north-east.
  turnin 8462
  accept 8461

step Felpaw Village
  tip The Deadwood furbolg village just west of the tunnel. Chieftain Bloodmaw (56) stands among them. Meilosh, a friendly furbolg, sits at the north end of the village.
  kill 7156 quest 8461.1
  kill 7157 quest 8461.2
  kill 7158 quest 8461.3
  accept 6031 optional                -- Meilosh: keep 30 Runecloth for him; he trades only at Neutral with the Timbermaw
  collect 20741 optional              -- Deadwood Ritual Totem, a rare drop
  accept 8470 optional

step Nafien
  turnin 8461
  accept 8465
  accept 8467 optional                -- Only with 5 Deadwood Headdress Feathers
  turnin 8467 optional
  note Keep Speak to Salfa for Winterspring.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Back south

step Emerald Sanctuary
  tip Ride the road south through Felwood to the Sanctuary.
  turnin 5156                         -- Taronn Redfeather
  turnin 5157                         -- Greta Mosshoof
  accept 5158
  turnin 5385 optional                -- Jessir Moonbow
  turnin 4102                         -- Maybess Riverbreeze, on the west side of the Sanctuary
  note Keep Seeking Spiritual Aid: Islen Waterseer is in the Barrens.

step Overlord Ror
  tip Ror stands at the far south end of Deadwood Village.
  collect 15879 quest 6162 @48.2,94.3

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- North to Winterspring

step Bloodvenom Post
  tip Ride north up the road again.
  turnin 6162                         -- Dreka'Sur

step Felpaw Village
  tip Back at Felpaw Village, the Deadwood furbolgs (53-54) are close to the tunnel and every kill raises your Timbermaw reputation.
  level 54 -- grind on Deadwood Avengers at Felpaw Village, Felwood
  turnin 8470 optional                -- Kernda, at the tunnel mouth

step Through Timbermaw Hold
  zone Winterspring
  tip Walk into the Timbermaw Hold tunnel beside Nafien and never attack the Timbermaw furbolgs inside. The tunnel opens into Winterspring; follow the road east to Everlook, the goblin town where the next guide starts.
  getfp "Everlook"
  sethome "Everlook"
